<title>USA: Lumisys to buy back 500,000 shrs.</title>
<headline>Lumisys to buy back 500,000 shrs.</headline>
<dateline>SUNNYVALE, Calif. 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lumisys Inc said its board of directors has approved the repurchase of up to 500,000 shares of common stock.</p>
<p>At the end of March the company had 6.74 million shares outstanding.</p>
<p>In a statement, the company said the repurchase will be made from time to time on the open market at prevailing market prices or in negotiated transactions off the market.</p>
<p>The repurchase program is expected to continue over the next 12 months but may be extended or shortened by the board.</p>
</text>
